components/ame/icons/ — icon set
================================================================================

Copyright (c) Schweizerische Eidgenossenschaft
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

The 218 glyphs in `components/ame/icons/icon-data.ts` are generated from
`components/ame/icons/icon-source.html`, a Storybook export of this set. The
generator is `scripts/parse-ame-icons.mjs`; it rewrites each glyph to inherit
`currentColor` and keeps the path data otherwise unchanged. The shapes are the
upstream's; the extraction, the normalisation and the React wrapper around them
(`icon.tsx`, `icon-fallback.tsx`) are this repository's and are Apache-2.0 with
the rest of the tree.

